  * @exampleResponse Selecting specific columns
  * ```json
  * {
  *   "data": [
  *     {
  *       "name": "Frodo"
  *     },
  *     {
  *       "name": "Harry"
  *     },
  *     {
  *       "name": "Katniss"
  *     }
