  * @exampleSql Query referenced tables
  * ```sql
  * create table
  *   orchestral_sections (id int8 primary key, name text);
  * create table
  *   instruments (
  *     id int8 primary key,
  *     section_id int8 not null references orchestral_sections,
  *     name text
  *   );
  *
  * insert into
  *   orchestral_sections (id, name)
  * values
  *   (1, 'strings'),
  *   (2, 'woodwinds');
  * insert into
  *   instruments (id, section_id, name)
  * values
  *   (1, 2, 'flute'),
  *   (2, 1, 'violin');
  * ```
  *
  * @exampleResponse Query referenced tables
  * ```json
  * {
  *   "data": [
  *     {
  *       "name": "strings",
  *       "instruments": [
  *         {
  *           "name": "violin"
  *         }
  *       ]
  *     },
  *     {
  *       "name": "woodwinds",
  *       "instruments": [
  *         {
  *           "name": "flute"
  *         }
  *       ]
  *     }
  *   ],
  *   "status": 200,
  *   "statusText": "OK"
  * }
  * ```
